            "review_title": "Review at Yu Shang Lou - Fine Chinese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Geoff\nLeigh-on Sea, United Kingdom226 contributions\n2\nLovely restaurant.\nJan 2020 • Family\nJust a cut above the stantard Chinese and Vietnamese restaurants. Nice atmosphere... Beautiful food so fresh and very tasty. Quality is good. Service is good. Yes a little bit more expensive than other restaurants but I have becoming to this restaurant for over two years and it is still presenting quality food and we love it.. So yes worth a vist...\nWritten January 2, 2020\nYu Shang L\nDear gedwar,\n\nThank you for sharing this wonderful review!! It was our pleasure to host you at Yu Shang Lou. Your kind words are definitely appreciated and will share with the team.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back again in the future!\n\nBest Regards,\nKen Lew\nOperation Manager\nRead more\nWritten January 21, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
