            "review_title": "Review at Yu Shang Lou - Fine Chinese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Kevin C\nBangkok, Thailand46 contributions\n0\nCozy Dinner at Yu Shang Lou\nAug 2018\nI have had a very nice dinner at this restaurant yesterday. It’s a good change from the usual Vietnamese food. In fact the Cantonese cuisine in the menu were so tempting. As single traveller I’ve picked 3 small dishes to savor. \n\nThe service was exceptionally good with the waiter trying to communicate with their best effect. Finally the waiter spoke in Mandarin and the rest was so easy. \n\nThe dishes were very delicious, especially the cracking roast pork, so crispy on the skin and yet juicy as you bite it in your mouth. \n\nAfter dinner, I was given free tasting of their moon cake as it was near the festival. The moon cake was very tasty. I ended up purchasing 1 box of 4 pieces to take home. \n\nWill definitely visit this restaurant again in my next visit to HCMC. The attentive waiter has made a difference for my first experience in this restaurant.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 24, 2018\nYu Shang L\nDear Mr. Kevin,\n\nGreeting from YU SHANG LOU,\n\nThank you so much for your enjoying our food and sharing your experiences here.\nwe wish to welcome you back somedays.\n\nHave a nice day Sir.\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
