            "review_text": "TravelingNaughty\ncalifornia7 contributions\n0\nGreat last meal in Vietnam.\nMay 2018 • Couples\nWe spent the last night in Ho Chi Minh City before flying home at a hotel close to the airport. Yu Shang Lou was close by, and we decided to give it a try. We did not get there until about 9 pm, and were taken very good care of the moment we walked in. Service was excellent, and the food recommended by the owner was delicious. Decor was top notch, and the tanks on the ground floor held many different types of shellfish and fish.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2018\nYu Shang L\nDear Sir/Madam,\n\nIt's great to read your review and we hope to welcome you back in the next time.\n\nHave a good day from YU SHANG LOU.\nRead more\nWritten May 28, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
