            "review_text": "BKBCRV\nSacramento, California17 contributions\n0\nWonderful respite\nMay 2018 • Couples\nWalked in off the street straight from the airport. Hot, tired, hungry and its about 9:45 . The feel of AC was a welcome relief. We are taken upstairs and the owner introduces himself and suggests what to order roasted meat combo and special fried rice. We have duck, pork belly and chicken. There was a lot of staff hovering around waiting to help us. The owner even comped us some wine as a welcome for visitors. VEry nice and food was good special sauces paired perfectly with each meat. THey had a huge selection of live fish never seen so many types crustaceans before. Upscale fancy nice interior and good wine. Menu didn't seem to have any vegetable dishes. Definitely try this if you want cool quiet dining with good service.\nT\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 11, 2018\nYu Shang L\nDear Sir,\n\nGreeting from Yu Shang Lou! I appreciate and do hope to welcome you again.\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
